THE SHORT VERSION

Look all you like. Learn from it. Don't republish it as your own, and don't
sell it.


WHAT YOU MAY DO

You may play the game.

You may read the source code. It is delivered to your browser in order to run,
so reading it is unavoidable and entirely welcome. You may study how it works
and learn from it, including by taking a local copy for that purpose.

You may quote short excerpts of the code when discussing, teaching, reviewing,
or reporting on it, with attribution.

You may link to the game freely.


